WEBVTT

00:00:01.140 --> 00:00:03.580
kanashimi sasou midnight

00:00:01.140 --> 00:00:03.580
Such a sad midnight,

00:00:04.870 --> 00:00:09.520
koboreru ai o choudai

00:00:04.870 --> 00:00:09.520
overflowing with love.

00:00:17.050 --> 00:00:20.090
kiiroi ringo o kajitteru

00:00:17.170 --> 00:00:20.030
Gnawing at a yellow apple,

00:00:20.090 --> 00:00:24.050
kimi wa hitoshirezu otona ni naru

00:00:20.090 --> 00:00:24.050
you secretly become an adult.

00:00:24.500 --> 00:00:27.490
tameiki iro shite mayoikomu

00:00:24.500 --> 00:00:27.490
You sigh, having lost your way

00:00:27.490 --> 00:00:31.260
ai o sagashite ikiteru

00:00:27.490 --> 00:00:31.260
living in a search for love.

00:00:31.600 --> 00:00:35.540
suki yo tabun ne dakedo

00:00:31.600 --> 00:00:35.540
Maybe I love you, but—

00:00:35.560 --> 00:00:38.980
akai tsuki ga miteru

00:00:35.560 --> 00:00:38.980
the red moon is watching,

00:00:39.020 --> 00:00:45.570
konna ni mo chikaku ni iru no ni

00:00:39.020 --> 00:00:45.570
it waits nearby.

00:00:46.330 --> 00:00:50.030
kanashimi sasou midnight

00:00:46.330 --> 00:00:50.030
Such a sad midnight.

00:00:48.480 --> 00:00:50.100
I can say love

00:00:50.100 --> 00:00:53.830
koboreru ai o choudai

00:00:50.100 --> 00:00:53.830
It overflows with love.

00:00:52.250 --> 00:00:53.830
will you love me?

00:00:53.850 --> 00:00:57.440
tomadoi no hitomi no oku

00:00:53.850 --> 00:00:57.440
Lost within your eyes,

00:00:57.510 --> 00:01:00.390
kokyuu o tomete

00:00:57.510 --> 00:01:00.390
I stop breathing.

00:01:00.620 --> 00:01:03.950
kimi no ai o katachi ni

00:01:00.620 --> 00:01:03.950
The shape of your love,

00:01:04.280 --> 00:01:08.600
mayonaka no taiyou

00:01:04.280 --> 00:01:08.600
is like the midnight sun.

00:01:20.680 --> 00:01:21.310
It's no use!

00:01:21.310 --> 00:01:23.910
I've only been trained to safely deliver cargo!

00:01:23.910 --> 00:01:26.300
It's too easy for them to anticipate my course changes!

00:01:26.510 --> 00:01:28.380
S-So then what do we do?!

00:01:28.460 --> 00:01:29.710
I know.

00:01:29.710 --> 00:01:32.250
Why don't we let Seina-chan set our course?

00:01:32.250 --> 00:01:33.050
Good thinking!

00:01:33.050 --> 00:01:34.510
Seina-kun is a complete novice!

00:01:35.020 --> 00:01:36.350
M-Me?!

00:01:36.560 --> 00:01:37.590
That's right!

00:01:37.590 --> 00:01:39.680
Enter a new jump course at random!

00:01:39.990 --> 00:01:40.810
Please!

00:01:41.190 --> 00:01:42.060
Please!

00:01:43.760 --> 00:01:46.560
I-I don't think this is a good idea...

00:02:11.120 --> 00:02:12.290
The treasure's ours!

00:02:12.290 --> 00:02:14.550
Destroy any ships that get in our way!

00:02:15.690 --> 00:02:16.740
Prey...

00:02:16.740 --> 00:02:18.520
My prey...

00:02:18.830 --> 00:02:23.310
No matter how many other ships there are, that treasure will be mine...

00:02:24.770 --> 00:02:26.950
Hundreds of ships?!

00:02:26.950 --> 00:02:29.690
Treasure! Treasure! Treasure!

00:02:29.740 --> 00:02:34.010
Let's blast 'em up good and swipe their treasure!

00:02:34.010 --> 00:02:36.280
Yahoo! I love bein' a pira-

00:02:39.150 --> 00:02:40.800
W-What was that for?!

00:02:40.800 --> 00:02:42.820
Actin' all tough 'cuz you're a lieutenant!

00:02:42.820 --> 00:02:45.920
Tell this good-for-nothing...

00:02:54.550 --> 00:02:55.410
Why?

00:02:55.410 --> 00:02:56.830
Why are we withdrawing?!

00:02:56.830 --> 00:02:57.970
We could've had-

00:02:59.540 --> 00:03:00.930
Look at that!

00:03:03.270 --> 00:03:05.740
We were mixed together with that huge fleet?! {mixed together?}

00:03:05.740 --> 00:03:07.510
Y-You don't see that everyday.

00:03:07.510 --> 00:03:09.440
And it's all for one GP ship!

00:03:09.710 --> 00:03:10.630
Wait,

00:03:10.630 --> 00:03:13.700
it feels like something is drawing us toward it.

00:03:13.890 --> 00:03:15.820
Perhaps it's a new model decoy ship.

00:03:15.820 --> 00:03:17.290
Contact the consort ship.

00:03:17.290 --> 00:03:19.090
It's just your imagination...

00:03:19.090 --> 00:03:21.290
Forget about it! Let's go get 'em!

00:03:21.660 --> 00:03:23.760
We're picking up an immense energy signature!

00:03:23.760 --> 00:03:25.290
An old transmission code!

00:03:25.560 --> 00:03:26.960
Triple-Z!

00:03:26.960 --> 00:03:28.290
I-It can't be!

00:03:37.800 --> 00:03:40.480
The Triple-Z is issued when the Mikagami's about to ambush someone!

00:03:40.480 --> 00:03:42.720
The Devil Princess of Jurai's genocide dance!

00:04:13.710 --> 00:04:14.950
The Mikagami!

00:04:14.950 --> 00:04:17.130
The Devil Princess of Jurai's elite military fleet!

00:04:17.380 --> 00:04:18.950
It was a decoy ship!

00:04:18.950 --> 00:04:22.060
I feel like there's a secret hidden aboard that GP ship.

00:04:22.120 --> 00:04:23.370
Its systems?

00:04:23.370 --> 00:04:25.410
Or maybe its technology?

00:04:25.410 --> 00:04:28.590
Either way, it will be easy to find out once it's mine.

00:04:28.590 --> 00:04:29.730
No time at all...

00:04:40.830 --> 00:04:41.990
Seriously?!

00:04:41.990 --> 00:04:42.740
Yes.

00:04:43.170 --> 00:04:45.040
However, due to present circumstances,

00:04:45.040 --> 00:04:46.690
we can only provide temporary repairs for you.

00:04:46.690 --> 00:04:47.750
We greatly appreciate it.

00:04:48.130 --> 00:04:51.380
We would like to hear the details of this incident from you,

00:04:51.380 --> 00:04:53.250
so would you to accompany us to the Mikagami?

00:04:53.640 --> 00:04:55.250
O-Okay.

00:04:55.730 --> 00:04:57.820
Let's go with them!

00:04:57.820 --> 00:04:58.720
I can come, too?

00:04:59.250 --> 00:05:01.120
Go on ahead, then.

00:05:01.120 --> 00:05:04.250
I'll meet up with you once I've collected the data.

00:05:12.340 --> 00:05:14.800
That's a spaceship?

00:05:14.800 --> 00:05:16.020
That's right.

00:05:16.020 --> 00:05:20.110
Seto-sama's second generation Juraian spaceship, the Mikagami!

00:05:24.360 --> 00:05:27.630
Mitoto-sama, Yamada-dono, please wait here.

00:05:27.630 --> 00:05:28.750
O-Okay...

00:05:29.030 --> 00:05:31.620
I shall be your guide.

00:05:31.900 --> 00:05:33.180
This way.

00:06:11.390 --> 00:06:13.670
W-What is this place?

00:06:17.360 --> 00:06:18.230
Um,

00:06:18.230 --> 00:06:20.920
is this really the inside of a spaceship?

00:06:21.070 --> 00:06:22.200
No,

00:06:22.200 --> 00:06:26.350
this residential area is posited within subspace,

00:06:26.350 --> 00:06:29.070
so technically we're not inside the Mikagami.

00:06:29.070 --> 00:06:29.770
I see...

00:06:30.470 --> 00:06:31.480
Subspace?

00:06:33.130 --> 00:06:33.850
Posited?

00:06:35.380 --> 00:06:37.320
I have no idea what any of that means...

00:06:43.690 --> 00:06:46.460
Don't hesitate to ask if you need anything.

00:06:46.460 --> 00:06:46.950
Um...

00:06:47.130 --> 00:06:48.060
Yes?

00:06:48.060 --> 00:06:49.660
Is there a phone here?

00:06:49.660 --> 00:06:50.950
It's right over there.

00:06:51.460 --> 00:06:54.210
Can it connect to Earth?

00:06:54.540 --> 00:06:58.640
Bringing a pure blooded Earthling on board is forbidden,

00:06:58.640 --> 00:07:01.670
but that doesn't mean it's never happened before.

00:07:01.670 --> 00:07:03.470
But...

00:07:03.720 --> 00:07:04.680
BUSY

00:07:04.980 --> 00:07:06.980
Despite the clerical mistakes made,

00:07:06.980 --> 00:07:10.410
his application was officially accepted.

00:07:07.470 --> 00:07:08.180
BUSY

00:07:09.680 --> 00:07:11.560
BUSY

00:07:10.410 --> 00:07:13.050
It's up to him,

00:07:10.680 --> 00:07:11.560
BUSY

00:07:11.310 --> 00:07:11.560
BUSY

00:07:13.050 --> 00:07:17.900
but I can't imagine him passing up a chance like this.

00:07:22.290 --> 00:07:23.750
But, Seto-sama...

00:07:23.750 --> 00:07:24.890
Bye.

00:07:27.760 --> 00:07:30.670
Yamada Seina-kun...

00:07:30.670 --> 00:07:33.000
To think she was seeing a boy like this...

00:07:38.340 --> 00:07:42.810
I've heard about Seina-kun from my father.

00:07:42.810 --> 00:07:47.680
He's a friend of Kai-kun and a bit on the unlucky side.

00:07:47.680 --> 00:07:49.250
A bit?

00:07:50.390 --> 00:07:52.590
He managed to attract all those pirate ships.

00:07:52.590 --> 00:07:55.110
I'd say it's more than a bit.

00:08:02.700 --> 00:08:05.770
I think he has good luck.

00:08:05.770 --> 00:08:10.830
The odds of a pure blooded Earthling making it into space are remote.

00:08:11.340 --> 00:08:13.010
And he had to meet Seto-sama...

00:08:13.010 --> 00:08:14.220
I know...

00:08:14.220 --> 00:08:15.710
What are you whispering?

00:08:15.710 --> 00:08:16.580
Oh, nothing!

00:08:16.630 --> 00:08:21.410
Wow, today has been a great day!

00:08:23.260 --> 00:08:26.300
Who would have thought that Mitoto-sama was also aboard that ship?

00:08:26.790 --> 00:08:31.280
I heard she was in charge of cleaning the GP headquarters.

00:08:37.980 --> 00:08:38.870
Seto-sama.

00:08:38.870 --> 00:08:41.770
I've identified the first person he came in contact with.

00:08:42.470 --> 00:08:43.910
Amane Kaunaq.

00:08:43.910 --> 00:08:45.280
2nd-class detective.

00:08:45.740 --> 00:08:48.880
The Kaunaq family? Oh, it's her.

00:08:48.880 --> 00:08:52.280
That reminds me, I promised to find her a husband.

00:08:52.820 --> 00:08:56.290
I heard her family is against her being in the GP.

00:08:56.460 --> 00:08:58.690
She sure is a handful.

00:08:58.690 --> 00:09:03.070
The Kaunaqs are hoping she'll get married and settle down.

00:09:03.070 --> 00:09:06.760
But doesn't she have a history of rejecting possible suitors? {something else?}

00:09:07.160 --> 00:09:09.180
They were very entertaining.

00:09:09.340 --> 00:09:10.830
Entertaining?

00:09:10.830 --> 00:09:12.180
For example...

00:09:12.340 --> 00:09:14.810
when presented with a man who had a bad mother's complex,

00:09:14.990 --> 00:09:17.930
she grabbed him by the collar and yelled, "You call yourself a man?!"

00:09:18.280 --> 00:09:21.060
When she was set up with a man with a big ego and an attitude to match,

00:09:21.080 --> 00:09:24.650
she not only beat him up, but she also had a huge fight with his parents.

00:09:25.250 --> 00:09:30.150
There just aren't many men out there who can meet her expectations.

00:09:32.990 --> 00:09:35.990
Could the it be that they were poorly chosen?

00:09:35.990 --> 00:09:37.410
Kanemitsu-sama...

00:09:38.730 --> 00:09:42.370
She's purposely choosing men who she's likely to start trouble with.

00:09:42.370 --> 00:09:43.290
I see.

00:09:43.470 --> 00:09:46.870
Then I tried setting her up with one of my own relatives.

00:09:46.870 --> 00:09:49.050
They got along quite well, but...

00:09:49.050 --> 00:09:49.510
But?!

00:09:49.590 --> 00:09:54.950
They became such good friends that he's going to marry her best friend.

00:09:54.950 --> 00:09:57.310
Here's the invitation.

00:09:57.770 --> 00:09:59.920
But, yes...

00:09:59.920 --> 00:10:01.810
What if...

00:10:02.150 --> 00:10:03.550
Say, Kanemitsu-dono.

00:10:03.550 --> 00:10:04.420
What is it?

00:10:04.420 --> 00:10:06.980
Regarding our previous discussion,

00:10:06.980 --> 00:10:11.760
do you think a boy with his upbringing would pass up a chance like this?

00:10:11.760 --> 00:10:15.530
I get the feeling you're going to make him do it no matter what he thinks.

00:10:15.530 --> 00:10:16.530
Hmm?

00:10:17.600 --> 00:10:21.540
I mean... if it were me, I would never pass up such an opportunity!

00:10:22.450 --> 00:10:25.790
In that case, let's go meet him!

00:10:42.320 --> 00:10:44.060
<i>S-Seina-kun...</i>

00:10:44.590 --> 00:10:45.590
<i>Listen closely.</i>

00:10:45.590 --> 00:10:47.570
<i>Whatever happens, promise me this.</i>

00:10:48.090 --> 00:10:50.860
<i>Make sure you do absolutely nothing to upset Seto-sama.</i>

00:10:51.400 --> 00:10:53.240
<i>Understood?</i>

00:10:53.760 --> 00:10:55.930
What's the matter, Seina-chan?

00:10:55.930 --> 00:10:56.410
Nothing...

00:10:57.200 --> 00:11:03.120
<i>Seto-san, based on how the guide acted, must be really scary.</i>

00:11:03.910 --> 00:11:05.210
This way.

00:11:05.210 --> 00:11:06.770
O-Okay.

00:11:15.800 --> 00:11:18.640
Welcome to the Mikagami, Yamada Seina-dono.

00:11:19.160 --> 00:11:20.590
Pleased to meet you.

00:11:20.590 --> 00:11:22.890
I am Kamiki Seto Jurai.

00:11:23.290 --> 00:11:25.130
<i>She's so pretty...</i>

00:11:25.130 --> 00:11:27.230
<i>She's the Devil Princess?</i>

00:11:27.230 --> 00:11:29.900
<i>The behind-the-scenes supreme authority figure of a major power?</i> {Huh?}

00:11:30.700 --> 00:11:31.280
H-Hello!

00:11:31.280 --> 00:11:32.400
I-I'm Yamada Seina!

00:11:32.400 --> 00:11:33.400
I-It's a pleasure to meet you!

00:11:37.010 --> 00:11:41.340
I'm Hirata Kanemitsu, commander of the 7th Armada.

00:11:41.340 --> 00:11:43.620
And I'm intelligence officer Masaki Minaho.

00:11:44.010 --> 00:11:45.350
H-How do you do...

00:11:45.350 --> 00:11:46.370
Masaki?

00:11:47.170 --> 00:11:50.090
The same last name as Tenchi-senpai?

00:11:50.430 --> 00:11:52.260
It's been a long time, Mitoto-sama.

00:11:52.260 --> 00:11:54.020
I never expected to run into you here.

00:11:54.020 --> 00:11:55.840
You look well, Seto-sama.

00:11:56.210 --> 00:11:57.690
Oh, that reminds me...

00:11:57.690 --> 00:12:00.850
I believe your family has contacted us.

00:12:01.370 --> 00:12:03.330
Could it be my father?

00:12:03.330 --> 00:12:05.000
You can speak with him over here.

00:12:05.000 --> 00:12:05.940
Oh, really?

00:12:06.340 --> 00:12:08.910
I'll be back in a minute...

00:12:08.910 --> 00:12:09.740
Wait!

00:12:09.740 --> 00:12:11.190
Follow me, Seina-dono.

00:12:11.330 --> 00:12:13.190
O-Okay.

00:12:20.420 --> 00:12:21.000
Have some.

00:12:21.070 --> 00:12:22.200
T-Thank you.

00:12:23.220 --> 00:12:26.410
What an awful ordeal you just went through, Seina-dono. {situation?}

00:12:26.750 --> 00:12:27.660
N-No...

00:12:27.660 --> 00:12:30.330
First, let me express my gratitude.

00:12:30.540 --> 00:12:32.550
Thank you, Seina-dono.

00:12:33.070 --> 00:12:37.270
From what I hear, you were the one who set the jump coordinates.

00:12:37.270 --> 00:12:38.340
Y-Yes...

00:12:38.340 --> 00:12:39.810
I was asked to.

00:12:39.620 --> 00:12:41.800
And you saw what happened...

00:12:41.800 --> 00:12:43.970
Your gathering of the pirates?

00:12:44.660 --> 00:12:45.730
Seina-dono.

00:12:45.730 --> 00:12:48.780
Pirates are scattered all throughout space, but thanks to you,

00:12:48.860 --> 00:12:50.980
we've arrested hordes of them in one fell swoop!

00:12:51.360 --> 00:12:54.100
I've been unlucky for as long as I can remember.

00:12:54.100 --> 00:12:56.740
Every jump we made there were pirates waiting.

00:12:56.740 --> 00:13:01.070
I've been using the 7th Armada as part of an anti-pirate force

00:13:01.070 --> 00:13:04.240
to uncover piracy on a large scale.

00:13:04.240 --> 00:13:08.850
But you've single-handedly outperformed all of our combined efforts!

00:13:08.850 --> 00:13:13.500
If you can make your bad luck work for you, it would be quite a gift.

00:13:13.700 --> 00:13:15.500
Gift?

00:13:15.670 --> 00:13:16.460
Yes.

00:13:16.460 --> 00:13:20.510
I'm sure the GP would gladly welcome your gift, Seina-dono.

00:13:21.390 --> 00:13:22.510
Gladly welcome?

00:13:23.310 --> 00:13:24.500
Oh, right.

00:13:24.500 --> 00:13:26.020
How unfortunate, though.

00:13:26.970 --> 00:13:28.300
Seina-dono.

00:13:28.300 --> 00:13:36.530
It is prohibited to bring pure blooded Earthlings into space since their civilization lacks the technology.

00:13:36.580 --> 00:13:37.900
Y-You can't be serious!

00:13:38.750 --> 00:13:42.880
Y-Your "gift" is truly a Sword of Damocles.

00:13:42.880 --> 00:13:47.290
I, too, am disappointed, but we can't put you in harm's way.

00:13:47.290 --> 00:13:50.420
We will safely return you to Earth.

00:13:50.420 --> 00:13:51.870
However, in accordance with regulation...

00:13:52.290 --> 00:13:55.880
we must also erase your memory.

00:13:56.680 --> 00:13:58.090
Erase my memory?!

00:13:58.730 --> 00:14:01.430
Exceptions have been made before.

00:14:02.540 --> 00:14:06.540
There have been a few special cases in the past that were approved.

00:14:06.540 --> 00:14:07.630
Really?!

00:14:07.630 --> 00:14:08.110
Then...

00:14:08.110 --> 00:14:09.020
Seina-dono.

00:14:09.910 --> 00:14:14.150
Just as Kanemitsu says, your gift is also extremely dangerous!

00:14:14.150 --> 00:14:18.360
But if you return to Earth, your life won't be at risk...

00:14:18.570 --> 00:14:22.360
Despite this, do you still want to join the GP?

00:14:32.890 --> 00:14:38.090
I...want to go into space, and see all kinds of things...

00:14:38.170 --> 00:14:44.590
I can go to places and see things I never could on Earth!

00:14:45.390 --> 00:14:48.100
So I want to stay here... in space...

00:14:48.440 --> 00:14:49.850
I want to join the GP!

00:14:53.220 --> 00:14:55.120
Very well.

00:14:55.120 --> 00:14:58.760
We have no right to keep a man from his decision...

00:14:58.760 --> 00:14:59.860
Then...

00:15:00.020 --> 00:15:03.860
I will talk to the board and have them make an exception for you.

00:15:04.480 --> 00:15:06.770
Th-Thank you!

00:15:06.770 --> 00:15:07.370
Thank you!

00:15:07.890 --> 00:15:09.130
Thank you!

00:15:09.130 --> 00:15:10.120
Thank you!

00:15:10.890 --> 00:15:13.870
I fell for the exact same trick...

00:15:16.390 --> 00:15:17.860
Starting main generators.

00:15:17.860 --> 00:15:19.390
All functions check out.

00:15:19.390 --> 00:15:20.890
All systems are green.

00:15:20.890 --> 00:15:22.880
Generator output stable.

00:15:23.260 --> 00:15:25.130
Preparations for departure complete.

00:15:25.730 --> 00:15:27.770
Thank you, Seto-sama.

00:15:27.770 --> 00:15:30.850
I'm sorry we could only perform temporary repairs for you.

00:15:30.850 --> 00:15:34.600
N-No, that's okay! Your assistance is truly appreciated!

00:15:35.010 --> 00:15:37.640
Mitoto-sama, let's have tea sometime.

00:15:37.640 --> 00:15:39.380
I'd love to!

00:15:39.380 --> 00:15:40.320
Seina-dono.

00:15:40.660 --> 00:15:41.570
Y-Yes?

00:15:42.250 --> 00:15:44.070
Try hard!

00:15:45.150 --> 00:15:46.180
Okay!

00:15:58.770 --> 00:16:02.870
Come to think of it, weren't you going to recruit him?

00:16:02.870 --> 00:16:06.880
I couldn't dream of taking her fun away.

00:16:07.470 --> 00:16:10.260
He's going to be very surprised when he sees her...

00:16:13.650 --> 00:16:15.290
Entering hyperspace jump.

00:16:15.290 --> 00:16:16.590
Are preparations complete?

00:16:16.590 --> 00:16:17.310
Affirmative!

00:16:18.700 --> 00:16:21.820
We can finally make our way to the immigration station...

00:16:39.680 --> 00:16:41.920
We've safely exited our hyperspace jump...

00:16:42.080 --> 00:16:43.420
What?! Again?!

00:16:43.520 --> 00:16:45.950
There's a ship rapidly approaching us from ahead!

00:16:45.950 --> 00:16:47.110
Pirates!

00:16:50.760 --> 00:16:52.100
Uh... what?

00:16:55.060 --> 00:16:57.600
S-Sorry, it's my gift...

00:16:58.030 --> 00:16:59.370
The pirate ship's hailing us!

00:16:59.370 --> 00:17:01.030
They wish to negotiate in person.

00:17:01.030 --> 00:17:02.360
Negotiate what?!

00:17:02.650 --> 00:17:05.500
I've identified the pirate ship.

00:17:06.940 --> 00:17:07.860
No way!

00:17:08.230 --> 00:17:11.530
It's Ryoko Balouta's ship!

00:17:13.920 --> 00:17:14.790
Yahoo!

00:17:15.280 --> 00:17:16.680
Negotiations agreed to!

00:17:16.680 --> 00:17:18.270
Hey! Who said you could?!

00:17:18.270 --> 00:17:20.420
Hurry the preparations!

00:17:20.420 --> 00:17:23.210
This ship belongs to the GP!

00:17:23.210 --> 00:17:26.000
We absolutely cannot allow pir...

00:17:54.350 --> 00:17:55.420
Surprise!

00:17:55.420 --> 00:17:57.790
Welcome!

00:17:58.000 --> 00:17:59.790
Welcome, Ryoko-sama!

00:18:00.880 --> 00:18:03.290
T-Thank you very much.

00:18:03.670 --> 00:18:05.160
What's going on?

00:18:06.440 --> 00:18:11.830
Ryoko Balouta is an idolized pirate and even has a lot of fans in the GP.

00:18:11.830 --> 00:18:13.300
Fans?!

00:18:13.430 --> 00:18:15.510
Welcome aboard, Ryoko-san!

00:18:15.880 --> 00:18:17.540
Mi-Mitoto-sama!

00:18:17.540 --> 00:18:19.310
It's good to see you again.

00:18:19.870 --> 00:18:21.740
Who would've thought we'd meet here?

00:18:21.740 --> 00:18:23.540
I'm grateful for your assistance back then.

00:18:23.540 --> 00:18:27.690
Oh, but all I did was clean your ship.

00:18:27.690 --> 00:18:30.650
How come those two know each other?

00:18:30.650 --> 00:18:33.950
This is Mitoto-sama we're talking about.

00:18:34.590 --> 00:18:36.200
So what brings you here today?

00:18:36.570 --> 00:18:37.620
Oh, yes...

00:18:37.620 --> 00:18:39.690
Who is the captain of this ship?

00:18:39.690 --> 00:18:41.910
Oh, the captain is tied up at the moment...

00:18:43.330 --> 00:18:44.900
I'm the substitute captain.

00:18:44.900 --> 00:18:46.330
I'm the substitute captain's aide.

00:18:46.330 --> 00:18:48.160
I'm the substitute captain's substitute.

00:18:48.160 --> 00:18:49.800
So, how may we be of service?

00:18:50.600 --> 00:18:53.510
I was fortunate enough to witness the incident earlier.

00:18:53.950 --> 00:18:56.580
You mean the one with the Mikagami and the Armada?

00:18:56.580 --> 00:18:58.220
In regards to that incident...

00:18:58.890 --> 00:19:00.100
it was all his doing!

00:19:01.210 --> 00:19:02.980
As soon as he entered the coordinates...

00:19:02.980 --> 00:19:04.780
all these pirates started showing up...

00:19:04.780 --> 00:19:06.690
and you saw the rest.

00:19:06.690 --> 00:19:09.480
He lured all those ships on his own?!

00:19:09.480 --> 00:19:10.270
Yes!

00:19:10.270 --> 00:19:11.440
Isn't he just awful?!

00:19:12.360 --> 00:19:14.700
I see...

00:19:15.330 --> 00:19:18.120
Uh... um...

00:19:19.630 --> 00:19:21.430
May I ask you for your name?

00:19:21.430 --> 00:19:23.040
Y-Yamada Seina!

00:19:23.200 --> 00:19:27.440
Th-Though I didn't mean to gather them like that...

00:19:27.440 --> 00:19:29.750
Besides, this is a GP ship, and-

00:19:29.750 --> 00:19:30.720
Seina-dono.

00:19:31.340 --> 00:19:32.210
I'm sorry!

00:19:32.210 --> 00:19:34.010
I'll never do it again!

00:19:34.010 --> 00:19:34.780
I hope...

00:19:34.780 --> 00:19:37.850
Would you like to join my crew?

00:19:38.130 --> 00:19:41.850
You have a real gift, gathering all those pirates like that.

00:19:45.120 --> 00:19:47.990
Could I convince you to work with us?

00:19:48.780 --> 00:19:50.650
Ryoko-sama's hand!

00:19:50.800 --> 00:19:51.900
U-Um...

00:19:52.300 --> 00:19:55.240
If you join my crew,

00:19:55.240 --> 00:19:57.400
we will welcome you with the title of ship's captain.

00:19:57.400 --> 00:20:01.410
As my superior officer, you can give me any orders you want.

00:20:01.700 --> 00:20:02.570
S-Superior officer?!

00:20:02.570 --> 00:20:03.390
Orders?!

00:20:03.390 --> 00:20:04.120
Anything you want?!

00:20:04.290 --> 00:20:06.870
Well, you <i>are</i> my superior officer...

00:20:07.030 --> 00:20:09.630
Well, you <i>are</i> my superior officer...

00:20:09.920 --> 00:20:11.350
Well, you <i>are</i> my superior officer...

00:20:11.350 --> 00:20:12.340
Bossa Nova...

00:20:12.820 --> 00:20:14.090
Ohhhh yeah!

00:20:14.660 --> 00:20:16.120
What do you say?

00:20:16.120 --> 00:20:17.190
Uh, well...

00:20:17.190 --> 00:20:18.190
What a deal!

00:20:18.190 --> 00:20:19.330
Go for it!

00:20:19.330 --> 00:20:21.100
We'd be worried if you went by yourself!

00:20:21.280 --> 00:20:24.230
It's decided! We'll go for you!

00:20:24.230 --> 00:20:26.220
I have no need for you three!

00:20:28.910 --> 00:20:30.110
Is there any way I can convince you?

00:20:31.440 --> 00:20:32.520
Um...

00:20:33.330 --> 00:20:34.280
Seina-dono?

00:20:35.370 --> 00:20:36.450
I'm sorry.

00:20:36.450 --> 00:20:37.780
I can't.

00:20:38.310 --> 00:20:39.450
Why not?

00:20:39.450 --> 00:20:39.990
Why not?!

00:20:40.620 --> 00:20:43.980
Because I promised someone I would join the GP.

00:20:43.980 --> 00:20:45.120
And there is no changing your mind?

00:20:45.120 --> 00:20:46.220
No, and besides...

00:20:46.220 --> 00:20:47.210
Besides?

00:20:47.550 --> 00:20:50.460
And besides... I think piracy is wrong!

00:20:58.460 --> 00:21:02.240
Our negotiations were unsuccessful, so we'll take our leave now.

00:21:02.240 --> 00:21:03.960
Thank you for your tiring work!

00:21:03.960 --> 00:21:05.100
Seina-dono.

00:21:05.100 --> 00:21:07.310
The next time we meet will be as enemies.

00:21:08.240 --> 00:21:09.340
Yes.

00:21:09.340 --> 00:21:13.230
Sorry to bother you, but could we take a commemorative picture?!

00:21:18.240 --> 00:21:20.740
Until your next visit, Ryoko-sama!

00:21:18.530 --> 00:21:20.740
Take care of yourself, Ryoko-sama!

00:21:21.030 --> 00:21:23.240
Come visit us again sometime!

00:21:37.550 --> 00:21:42.180
Perhaps we should put that boy on the Pirate Guild's caution list?

00:21:42.180 --> 00:21:43.180
Agreed.

00:21:43.180 --> 00:21:45.140
I'll do that right now.

00:21:45.140 --> 00:21:46.260
Oh, wait a minute...

00:21:46.890 --> 00:21:49.310
On second thought, don't put him on the list.

00:21:50.420 --> 00:21:51.270
As you wish.

00:21:52.080 --> 00:21:53.380
Thank you.

00:21:55.390 --> 00:21:57.620
Yamada Seina, huh?

00:22:16.320 --> 00:22:21.660
uchuu de saitei saiaku

00:22:16.320 --> 00:22:21.660
You're the worst, most hopeless,

00:22:21.700 --> 00:22:26.780
un warui Unlucky Boy

00:22:21.700 --> 00:22:26.780
most unlucky boy in space.

00:22:32.320 --> 00:22:33.990
anna koto shite te mo

00:22:32.320 --> 00:22:33.990
No matter what you do,

00:22:35.010 --> 00:22:36.720
konna koto shite te mo

00:22:35.010 --> 00:22:36.720
no matter what you do,

00:22:36.990 --> 00:22:41.510
otozureru jiko tensai sugoi wana

00:22:36.990 --> 00:22:41.510
you can't escape the accidents, disasters and traps

00:22:41.510 --> 00:22:43.800
anata wa nigerarenai

00:22:41.510 --> 00:22:43.800
that come your way.

00:22:45.600 --> 00:22:47.370
keikai shite te mo

00:22:45.600 --> 00:22:47.370
Even if your really careful...

00:22:48.350 --> 00:22:50.080
ikinari shichatte mo

00:22:48.350 --> 00:22:50.080
And even if you're not...

00:22:50.340 --> 00:22:56.310
saitei saiaku dame dame no

00:22:50.340 --> 00:22:56.310
You're the worst and most hopeless...

00:22:56.310 --> 00:23:00.780
anata wa doshiyou mo nai

00:22:56.310 --> 00:23:00.780
You're a lost cause.

00:23:05.630 --> 00:23:10.730
anata ga saitei saiaku

00:23:05.630 --> 00:23:10.730
You're the worst and most hopeless...

00:23:11.180 --> 00:23:15.350
anata wa Unlucky Boy

00:23:11.180 --> 00:23:15.350
You're an unlucky boy.

00:23:15.350 --> 00:23:20.430
dakedo anata shika mienai

00:23:15.350 --> 00:23:20.430
But all I can see is you,

00:23:20.610 --> 00:23:25.950
sonna anata shika mienai

00:23:20.610 --> 00:23:25.950
just the way you are.

00:23:31.400 --> 00:23:35.300
We finally made it to an immigration station.

00:23:35.300 --> 00:23:38.440
And the person in charge is... Kiriko-san?

00:23:38.440 --> 00:23:40.840
What's Kiriko-san doing here?!

00:23:40.840 --> 00:23:42.710
Next time on Tenchi Muyo GXP!
